{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791297665661,"sessionID":"ses_eee574f8effem4yTnWXoVrPDsL","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-be3bdf7f14993127","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"[\n {\"id\": \"q1\", \"model\": \"atlas-pro\", \"effort\": \"high\"},\n {\"id\": \"q2\", \"model\": \"atlas-pro\", \"effort\": \"high\"},\n {\"id\": \"q3\", \"model\": \"Unrouted\", \"effort\": null},\n {\"id\": \"q4\", \"model\": \"atlas-lite\", \"effort\": \"high\"},\n {\"id\": \"q5\", \"model\": \"corvid-mini\", \"effort\": \"medium\"},\n {\"id\": \"q6\", \"model\": \"pellet-2\", \"effort\": \"high\"}\n]\n","filePath":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/glmflash-max__routing__r2__1791297629/work/answers.json"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/glmflash-max__routing__r2__1791297629/work/answers.json","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/glmflash-max__routing__r2__1791297629/work/answers.json","time":{"start":1791297665641,"end":1791297665653}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let me apply the policy to each request.\n\nModels:\n- atlas-pro | Northwind | nw | implement, review, research | floor high | ceiling max\n- atlas-lite | Northwind | nw | extract, prose | floor low | ceiling high\n- corvid-9 | Corvid | cv | implement, review | floor medium | ceiling max\n- corvid-mini | Corvid | cv | extract | floor low | ceiling medium\n- pellet-2 | Pellet | pl | prose, research | floor medium | ceiling high\n\nLane order:\n- implement: atlas-pro, corvid-9\n- review: corvid-9, atlas-pro\n- research: atlas-pro, pellet-2\n- extract: corvid-mini, atlas-lite\n- prose: pellet-2, atlas-lite\n\nR1: eligible only if lane in lanes column.\nR2: review lane → model family must differ from author_family.\nR3: pinned cli → only models on that cli.\nR4: skip unavailable.\nR5: no eligible → \"Unrouted\", effort null.\nR6: effort below floor → floor; above ceiling → ceiling; else keep. Effort never makes a model ineligible.\n\nq1: implement, medium.\n- atlas-pro: implement in lanes ✓. floor high. Requested medium < high → effort becomes high (R6). Eligible (R6 says effort never makes ineligible). First in order → atlas-pro, effort medium → below floor high → high.\nAnswer: {\"id\":\"q1\",\"model\":\"atlas-pro\",\"effort\":\"high\"}\n\nq2: review, high, author_family Corvid.\n- corvid-9: family Corvid = author_family Corvid → R2 fails. Skip.\n- atlas-pro: family Northwind ≠ Corvid ✓, review in lanes ✓, floor high, requested high → within [high, max] → keep high.\nAnswer: {\"id\":\"q2\",\"model\":\"atlas-pro\",\"effort\":\"high\"}\n\nq3: extract, low, pinned_cli pl.\n- corvid-mini: extract ✓ but cli cv ≠ pl → R3 fails.\n- atlas-lite: extract ✓, cli nw ≠ pl → fails.\nNo eligible → Unrouted, effort null.\nAnswer: {\"id\":\"q3\",\"model\":\"Unrouted\",\"effort\":null}\n\nq4: prose, max, unavailable pellet-2.\n- pellet-2: prose ✓ but unavailable → skip.\n- atlas-lite: prose ✓, floor low, ceiling high. Requested max > ceiling high → effort becomes high.\nAnswer: {\"id\":\"q4\",\"model\":\"atlas-lite\",\"effort\":\"high\"}\n\nq5: extract, max.\n- corvid-mini: extract ✓, floor low, ceiling medium. Requested max > medium → effort medium.\nAnswer: {\"id\":\"q5\",\"model\":\"corvid-mini\",\"effort\":\"medium\"}\n\nq6: research, high, pinned pl.\n- atlas-pro: research ✓ but cli nw ≠ pl → fails.\n- pellet-2: research ✓, cli pl ✓, floor medium, ceiling high. Requested high → within → keep high.\nAnswer: {\"id\":\"q6\",\"model\":\"pellet-2\",\"effort\":\"high\"}\n\nWrite answers.json:\n[\n {\"id\": \"q1\", \"model\": \"atlas-pro\", \"effort\": \"high\"},\n {\"id\": \"q2\", \"model\": \"atlas-pro\", \"effort\": \"high\"},\n {\"id\": \"q3\", \"model\": \"Unrouted\", \"effort\": null},\n {\"id\": \"q4\", \"model\": \"atlas-lite\", \"effort\": \"high\"},\n {\"id\": \"q5\", \"model\": \"corvid-mini\", \"effort\": \"medium\"},\n {\"id\": \"q6\", \"model\": \"pellet-2\", \"effort\": \"high\"}\n]","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_111a934e5001C1iszNF3ZWIF2D","sessionID":"ses_eee574f8effem4yTnWXoVrPDsL","messageID":"msg_111a914f4001VAvO1AkOwLokfy"}}
